    "regime_notes": "The sign-reversed signal passes the benchmark admission gates at 20D, but calendar results are regime-dependent: positive in 2020-2022 and 2027, negative in 2023-2026 and 2028-2031. Small 15-asset cross-section implies conservative uncertainty interpretation. 5D and 10D sign-reversed ICs also pass, but 20D is selected as the primary horizon due to strongest absolute IC and ICIR.",
